'''Aul's Uprising''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Onyx Amulet}} with four attainable variants.

==Item versions==


[[File:3.20 - Aul's Uprising (Crit Strike version) -- Enemy smoke effect.png|thumb|Enemies affected by the {{c|mod|Hits against Nearby Enemies have 50% increased Critical Strike Chance}} effect.]]

