The {{c|mod|Hits against Nearby Enemies have 50% increased Critical Strike Chance}} version of Aul's Uprising has a dark red/blue/black smoke visual effect on nearby enemies which trails when they move.

{{Item acquisition|page=Aul's Uprising (All Attributes)}}

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.6.0|
* Now grants 'Hits against nearby enemies have 50% increased chance to critically strike' (previously caused nearby enemies to have an additional 2% chance to receive a critical strike). This affects existing versions of this item.
* New versions of Aul's Uprising can now appear with mods that cause the new Aura skills (Zealotry and Malevolence) to reserve no mana.
